Z||000019||Tina||06-20-2001||11:02 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Butter:<BR><B> Ain't that v8 fun.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Too much almost  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>Went through a tank of gas just today.<P>The scoop is a Mopar 6 Pack BTW,available <BR>almost anywhere. Around $70<P>mrgone... I used clear plastic cleaner from 3 M on the ouside of lens.But also took them apart, and cleaned inside as well. Trim is just painted.<P>Now to the trunk release.<BR>Looks like I need the whole set-up, including the switch in the dash.<BR>All I got is the wire that was in the old decklid.<BR>Looks like, that is going to be very interesting to remove  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P>Good news is though,I finally got my Vacuum reservoir in the mail.<BR>The brakes really sucked the last couple days without it, can't wait to get that in.<P>Tina  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>BTW Pretty sure the manifold is a Victor Jr.<P>||||reg||1
Z||000020||SilverFieroV6||06-21-2001||03:25 AM||||NICE CAR<BR>looks nice Tina,  How long did it take you to get the car in this nice of shape?<BR>Sam||||reg||1
Z||000021||Tina||06-21-2001||06:04 PM||||Let's see, dug it out snow sometime in march.<BR>Drove it for one week,took it apart the next.<BR>Off to the body-shop till about middle of may.<BR>And then the memory testing chore of putting it back together.<P>The car is pretty much done now, well exept for a few electrical gremlins, the wing, ,automatic trunk release,sprucing things up underneath the hood.<BR>....ahhhh....<BR>Somebody please stop me..<P>In all reality, I think I just like to tinker with it.<BR>So it will probably never be done.<P>Tina<BR>BTW People like AusFiero don't help either  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>Can't wait until he really get's that site going.||||reg||1
Z||000022||Smoooooth GT||09-09-2001||06:19 AM||||Tina...  <BR>NICE ONE... I love it. hey.  that's my motor..??...  naa, guess not.lol<BR>I love tinkering to...  <BR>keep up the good work, maybe I'll get to see it when I get the Smoooth GT finished, at a show somewhere...  Steve<P>------------------<BR>NOS Injected 2.8L<BR>Future add's.. 2" drop, 17" wheel's, finish the turbo T-3watercooled project, ViperYellow <BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/smooth_sig2_4.JPG"> ||||reg||1
